DIAGNOSTIC: unmatched phrase marks take the L5 tone value

init_phr_feature_vars falls through to L11 (no tone value stored)
when the final mark matches none of the tested ids. This sends the
fall-through to L5 instead. If final hey! gains expression while
hey? and hey. stay put, bang was unmatched and L5's value is close
to right; tune after. Revert after the ear test.
diff --git a/lang/enus/rules/u_vars.dr b/lang/enus/rules/u_vars.dr
index 91f8590..7f460fd 100644
--- a/lang/enus/rules/u_vars.dr
+++ b/lang/enus/rules/u_vars.dr
@@ -1074,7 +1074,7 @@ label L4 was at_0x13b
   call testeq arity 1 depth 6
   popn 6
   cmp testl reg r0 reg r0
-  branch jne to L11
+  branch jne to L5
 label L5 was at_0x23c
   load movw ind reg r6 1566 into r0w
   jump to L10
